{"version":1,"content":"<p>Suica企鵝憑着圓碌碌的身形及呆萌表情深受歡迎，過往推出的周邊商品亦吸引不少粉絲收藏，最近再度與紀之國屋合作，推出限量版企鵝公仔環保袋，將可愛毛公仔與實用購物袋二合為一，更是紀之國屋最後一款與Suica企鵝聯乘商品，別具收藏價值。</p><p>今次推出</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:19:46.765730+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:00:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888044+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:05.888044+00:00","content_hash":"a0be9236179c24d3cf64c8da9618f0a5dd3d330d7be32fcde2b32c3b9877eeea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}